  "text": "Update provider working hours and calendar blocks\n\nTo keep appointment slots accurate, you can update regular working hours and add one-time calendar blocks for meetings or time off. \n\n1. Go to **Settings > Scheduling > Provider Hours**.\n2. Select the target clinician from the **Provider** dropdown menu.\n3. Adjust the weekly schedule by entering start and end times, or check **Day Off** for non-working days.\n4. To block specific dates, click **Add Block**, choose your start and end timestamps, and select a reason from the category list.\n5. Click **Save Changes** at the bottom of the page.\n\n### Limits and Conditions\nChanges apply immediately to future scheduling slots. Past appointments remain unaffected, and you cannot overlap a working-hours shift with an existing confirmed appointment.\n\n### Troubleshooting\nIf the calendar still displays incorrect availability, clear your browser cache and verify that no conflicting group-schedule overrides are active under **Settings > Scheduling > Facility Hours**. If issues persist, ensure the provider's primary time zone matches your clinic's main location setting."
 },
